<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2. </span>Out-of-distribution ASR on four external safety benchmarks for models trained on PKU-SafeRLHF-30K. Results are shown for Llama-3-8B and Qwen2.5-7B across wDPO  and DPO-family baselines. ASR is measured by two judges, and AVG reports the mean ASR over the four benchmarks.</figcaption>
